oject/Editor settings shows the tooltip but they disappear almost immediately without moving the mouse.\nWhich makes reading the docs impossible/very annoying.\n\n**Edit:** This seems to be a problem with the EditorInspector class, so I have the **same problem with the tooltips for the inspector docs**.\n\nThis is a regression bug, tooltips used to work fine on 4.3.\n\n4.4.1+ behavior:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9fc192c6-eac7-4a83-b54d-004a494781d7\n\n4.3 working:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c3b77636-4371-43f7-9558-4ae21247032a\n\n\n**Edit:** \nThis seems to be the same issue as https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104672\nChanging the PenTablet driver to dummy fixes this issue.\nI have this issue here even when I don't have a PenTablet connected.\nBut I do have waccom driver's installed.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open the project settings\n- Stop the mouse over one of the options\n- Don't move the mosue\n\nResult: tooltip automatically disappears after half a second \nExpected: tooltip stays there until the mouse is moved.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot relevant, happens in any new project.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"h